  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank Trust Fund to support ENCORE.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve expenditure management at the Central level and in the project provinces of Kasai. The WBTF manages the delivery of the larger WB ENCORE programme through strategy workshops (PDIA), PEA and flexible TA. This aligns with the delivery of the PARI impact statement &#x2018;DRC benefits from more democratic, accountable, inclusive and effective governance to deliver better pro-poor services and support lasting stability in DRC at a central level and in selected provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
